   "key": "next_step",
   "title": "Some concrete next steps",
   "text": "You could contact the Acid Maltase Deficiency Association, a patient group based in the United States that the atlas links to Pompe disease [E516c908, E3fa57b9, Ec799c2f]. You could also contact Pompe Deutschland e.V., a patient group based in Germany that the atlas links to Pompe disease [E1d8cf27, E696335b]. You could ask about joining the Patient Registry that the atlas links to Pompe disease [Ec799c2f, E74da709, E3fa57b9].",
